 para('正文对应动态引导、业主钱包月度缴费、月度分配及独立自托管 Oracle 测试环境。统一网站有三个环境，其中两个使用 Base Sepolia，均为 Chain ID 84532；私有演示链为20261008。截图来自隔离测试，具体合约、余额和日期可能不同。操作前应核对环境、产品和钱包。','The instructions cover dynamic guidance, household wallet payments, monthly distributions and the separate self-hosted Oracle test environment. The unified site has three environments, two on Base Sepolia with Chain ID 84532 and one private demo on Chain ID 20261008. Screenshots come from isolated tests and may show different contracts, balances or dates. Verify the environment, product and wallet before acting.')
