 para('测试网络Chain ID为20261008，Gas代币为DETH。首次登录时允许添加此网络，并核对当前RPC地址。隧道地址变化时需要更新RPC，但链编号、钱包地址和原链余额不变。127.0.0.1只指向使用者自己的电脑，远程同事不应使用本机端口地址。','The test network Chain ID is 20261008 and its gas token is DETH. Check the current RPC when adding the network. A tunnel change requires a new RPC URL but does not change the chain, accounts or existing balances. The address 127.0.0.1 points to the reader’s own computer and is not a remote access address.')
 para('在业务交易确认后点击交易哈希，即可打开对应的Blockscout页面。也可以将完整交易哈希、钱包地址或合约地址粘贴到浏览器顶部的搜索框。先核对状态、发送者、目标合约和区块，再检查代币转账与事件。登录和协议消息签名属于链下步骤，不会产生交易记录。','Click a confirmed transaction hash to open its Blockscout page. Alternatively, paste a full hash, account or contract into the explorer search field. Check status, sender, target and block, followed by token transfers and events. Login and agreement message signatures are off-chain and do not create transaction records.')
 sub('网络选择与会话隔离','Network selection and session isolation')
 para('进入 GitHub 首页后选择环境并点击 Launch App。业务页面右上角的网络按钮列出三个环境及链编号。两个 Base Sepolia 项目都使用84532，切换时无需重复切链，但必须在新环境重新签名登录，业务记录和会话不会合并。登录窗口同样可以切换环境。','Select an environment on the GitHub homepage and click Launch App. The network button in the application lists three environments and their Chain IDs. Both Base Sepolia entries use 84532. A switch between them does not require changing the wallet chain, but requires a new sign-in signature; records and sessions are not merged. The sign-in dialog also offers environment selection.')
 para('钱包签名验证完成后，页面先显示角色工作台和导航，产品资料、钱包余额和已保存记录分别加载。完整业务状态尚未读取时，相关交易按钮保持不可用，不能把加载中的金额理解为零。某部分查询失败时，可以单独重试该部分；业务状态加载失败后，原登录仍会保留，无需反复连接钱包或签名。','After the wallet signature is verified, the role workspace and navigation appear first. Product metadata, wallet balances and saved records load independently. Transaction controls remain unavailable until the required business state is loaded, and a pending amount does not mean zero. An unavailable section can be retried separately. If business-state loading fails, sign-in is retained without repeatedly connecting or signing again.')
 para('切换时，请先在 Rabby 确认目标网络，然后使用同一角色钱包重新签名登录。角色地址保持不变，但登录会话、产品、待确认操作和页面选择按链分别保存。切换不会把私链 mUSDC 兑换或转移为 Circle USDC。如果当前仍有待确认交易，系统会要求先在原页面或交易日志核对结果。拒绝钱包请求或目标服务不可用时，页面仍保留原网络。','To switch, confirm the destination network in Rabby and sign in again with the intended role. Role addresses remain unchanged, while sessions, products, pending operations and page selections are isolated by chain. Switching does not convert or bridge private-chain mUSDC into Circle USDC. Reconcile any pending operation on its original page or in the transaction log before switching. A rejected wallet request or unavailable destination leaves the application on its original network.')
 figure(ROOT/'docs/manual/assets'/('network-menu.'+lang+'.png'),L('统一入口的网络选择窗口。请选择需要测试的链，再在钱包核对网络并重新登录。','Network selection in the unified application. Select the chain, verify it in the wallet and sign in again.'),'.42\\textheight')
