 section('动态引导与交接','Dynamic guidance and handoffs')
 para('首次进入角色时，业务介绍说明设备、收益权、资金和参与者之间的关系。右侧操作引导显示当前产品、对象、必要条件、处理人和预期结果。可以暂停或收起引导，再从顶部“操作引导”恢复。完成状态来自业务与链上记录，不由“下一步”按钮决定。','The first-entry introduction explains equipment, rights, money and participant responsibilities. The guide panel identifies the product, object, prerequisites, handler and expected result. Pause or collapse it and reopen Operation guide from the top bar. Completion comes from business and chain state rather than a Next button.')
 para('参与者模式关注本人任务及交接等待。四角色演示模式可查看其他角色的待办，并打开角色登录入口，但仍需要切换到对应钱包并重新签名。它不是代签模式，也不会让投资者钱包获得中介权限。','Participant mode focuses on the connected participant’s tasks and handoffs. Four-role demonstration mode can inspect other roles’ tasks and open their login entry. The correct wallet and a new signature are still required. It does not sign on behalf of another role or grant intermediary authority to an investor.')
 para('每次点击“定位操作”都会进入相关页面并指向按钮、字段或阻塞条件。条件不足时，弹窗应提供具体处理入口。需要他人审批时切换到所示角色，需要补齐估值时进入报告编制，需要未来日期时由中介确认受控时间推进。只读查看不会被描述为不能执行的付款。','Locate operation opens the relevant page and identifies a control, field or prerequisite. If a condition is missing, use the specific remedy shown. Switch to the named reviewer, prepare the missing report or let the intermediary confirm the controlled time advancement. A read-only inspection is not presented as a blocked payment.')
 para('月度流程中，受托尚未批准本期估值时，应先完成审批。中介宣告新分配且存在实际可领取金额后，引导才交接到投资者。已经领取完的旧分配不会继续占据当前任务。投资者可以核对历史已领取金额与本期未宣告状态，并分别查看剩余净值。','In the monthly cycle, a pending trustee approval must be completed first. The guide hands off to investors only after a new declaration creates an actual claimable amount. Fully paid earlier distributions do not remain the current task. Investors can distinguish historical payments, an undeclared current period and remaining NAV.')
 intro_path=D/'assets'/('guide-overview.'+lang+'.png')
 if not intro_path.exists():intro_path=legacy/('guide-overview.'+lang+'.png')
 if intro_path.exists():
  t(r'\clearpage');sub('业务介绍与任务入口','Product overview and task entry');figure(intro_path,L('阅读后可开始当前任务，也可选择稍后了解。引导不会替参与者签名。','Read the overview and start the current task, or choose Later. The guide does not sign for a participant.'),'.62\\textheight')
 groups={'A':('应用入口','Application entry'),'B':('申请、估值与协议','Application, valuation and agreement'),'C':('凭证、入池与发行','Credentials, admission and publication'),'D':('资格、认购与结算','Qualification, subscriptions and settlement'),'E':('月度回款、估值与分配','Monthly collections, valuation and distributions'),'F':('份额转让与季度赎回','Peer transfers and quarterly redemption'),'G':('服务事件与受托处置','Servicing cases and trustee intervention'),'H':('到期关闭与凭证返还','Expiry, closure and credential release')};last=None
 for s in steps:
  code,title,actor,where,op,result,nextrole,image,*notes=s
  new_group=code[0]!=last;last=code[0]
  landscape()
  if new_group:t(r'\section{'+esc(L(*groups[code[0]]))+'}')
  sub(code+' '+title,code+' '+en[code][0]);t(r'\label{step:'+code+'}');para('本步由'+actor+'操作。进入'+where+'后，'+op,'This step is performed by '+en[code][1]+'. '+en[code][2]);para('操作成功后，'+result+'下一步，'+nextrole+'。','After this step, '+en[code][3][0].lower()+en[code][3][1:])
  if notes and lang=='zh':para(notes[0],'')
  matches=[c for c in captures if c['action']==map_action.get(code)and c['language']==lang]
  if code.startswith('E'):matches=[c for c in matches if c['scope']=='month1']
  else:matches=[c for c in matches if c['scope']=='issuance']
  if matches:
   name=matches[0]['id']+'.'+lang+'.png';path=D/'assets'/name
   if not path.exists():path=legacy/name
   caption=L('编号1标出本步需要核对或提交的控件。','Marker 1 identifies the control to inspect or submit for this step.')
  else:path=legacy/(image+'.png');caption=L('编号标出操作位置。插图来自隔离演练，金额和状态以当前产品为准。','Numbered controls identify the action. This isolated-test illustration may show earlier Chinese labels. Use the current product amounts and status.')
  if lang=='en' and english_shots:
   if code not in english_shots:raise RuntimeError('Missing English screenshot for '+code)
   path=english_manifest.parent/'assets'/english_shots[code]['file']
   caption='Marker 1 identifies the control or information to inspect for this step. Amounts and dates refer to the isolated demonstration.'
  if lang=='zh' and code in zh_shots:
   path=zh_manifest.parent/'assets'/zh_shots[code]['file'];caption='编号1标出本期需要核对或签署的操作。截图来自隔离测试，金额和日期以当前产品为准。'
  hall=D/'assets'/('remote-hall.'+lang+'.png')
  if not hall.exists():hall=legacy/('remote-hall.'+lang+'.png')
  if code=='D1' and hall.exists() and not (lang=='en' and english_shots):
   path=hall;caption=L('当前公网产品大厅。选定产品后，点击卡片右下角的认购入口。','Current public product hall. Select the product and use Subscribe at the lower right of its card.')
  context=path.with_name(path.stem+'-context.png');detail=path.with_name(path.stem+'-detail.png')
  if context.exists() and detail.exists() and not (lang=='en' and code in ['A1','A2','B8','D2']):
   figure(context,caption,('.44\\textheight' if new_group else '.56\\textheight') if lang=='en' else '.37\\textheight');target=D/'assets'/detail.name
   if detail.resolve()!=target.resolve():shutil.copy2(detail,target)
   assets.append(target.name);t(r'\begin{center}\includegraphics[width=.7\linewidth,height=1.55cm,keepaspectratio]{assets/'+target.name+r'}\end{center}')
  else:figure(path,caption,'.68\\textheight' if lang=='en' and code in ['B8','D2'] else '.60\\textheight')
  endland()
 section('现金流计算与估值','Cashflow calculations and valuation')
 para('预测按最多36个月可用历史数据形成同月季节性基线，再按退化、可用率、上网行为和电价日程逐期调整。没有12个完整月时，报告明确标记为暂定估算，需要审核人说明原因。发电和上网不平衡的样本需要核查，不能简单把上网比例截为100%后当作正常自用量。','The forecast uses up to 36 available historical months to form calendar-month seasonal baselines, then applies degradation, availability, export behavior and tariff schedules. Fewer than 12 complete months requires a labeled provisional estimate and review. Imbalanced generation and export samples require investigation rather than silently capping export at 100% and treating the result as valid self-use.')
 t(r'\[S_t=\max(G_t-E_t,0)\,q_t,\qquad B_t=S_t\,p^{grid}_t\,d_t.\]')
 para('G表示预测发电量，E表示经核验的合资格售电量，q表示自用交付系数。S是可交付自用电量，B是业主按折扣比例d支付的电费。直接从电网购买这部分电量的比较费用为S乘电网价，优惠额为该比较费用减业主付款。这里只比较交付的光伏电量，不声称业主全部电网账单都会降低相同比例。','G denotes forecast generation, E is validated eligible export and q is the self-use delivery factor. S is delivered self-use and B is the owner’s electricity payment at discount factor d. The grid-price comparison is S times the grid tariff. The difference is the saving on this delivered solar energy, not a claim that the owner’s entire grid bill falls by the same percentage.')
 t(r'\[C_t=(B_t+E_t p^{export}_t-K_t)\,f_t\,a_t,\qquad V_0=\sum_{t=1}^{60}\frac{\widehat C_t}{(1+r)^{\tau_t/12}}.\]')
 para('K表示约定由收益权承担的站点成本，f为本币换USDC的演示汇率，a为签署协议的归集比例。新协议默认归集100%，业主通过优惠电价保留利益。现金流按预计实际收款日期贴现，τ包含回款延迟。默认10%名义年折现率是定价假设，不是承诺收益，报告同时比较6%和14%。','K represents agreed station costs borne by the rights, f is the demo FX conversion into USDC and a is the signed assignment proportion. New agreements default to 100% assignment, with the owner retaining a benefit through the discounted tariff. Discounting uses expected cash-collection dates, so tau includes receipt delays. The default 10% nominal annual discount rate is a pricing assumption, not a promised return, and 6% and 14% sensitivities are also shown.')
 sub('折现率的含义与定价依据','Discount-rate meaning and pricing basis')
 para('折现率用于把未来各期预计收到的净现金流换算为估值日的价格。相同现金流下，折现率越高，现值越低。它与业主按电网价80%缴费的优惠比例、募集结算时自动留存10%现金的规则、投资者最后实现的净IRR均不是同一个参数。当前10%为演示定价假设，尚未依据本产品的实际回款和可比交易充分校准；6%及14%只是敏感性情景，不是收益概率区间。','The discount rate converts each expected future net receipt into a value on the valuation date. A higher rate reduces present value for unchanged cashflows. It differs from the owner paying 80% of the grid tariff, the pool retaining 10% of initial cash at settlement, and the investor\'s eventual net IRR. The current 10% is a demonstration pricing assumption, not yet fully calibrated against this product\'s realized collections and comparable transactions. The 6% and 14% cases are sensitivity scenarios, not a probability range.')
 t(r'\[r_{\mathrm{rights}}\approx r_{\mathrm{benchmark}}+\pi_{\mathrm{payment}}+\pi_{\mathrm{operations}}+\pi_{\mathrm{legal/liquidity}}.\]')
 para('定价时可先选估值币种及与现金流期限相近的低风险基准，再评估业主缴费和电网售电回款、发电与运营、数据完整性、合同执行及流动性风险。上式是需要证据支持的校准框架，不会自动给出唯一正确利率。中介应根据协议条款、历史缴费、售电结算凭证、电站运行、退出限制和可比交易记录每项溢价的理由，受托管理人再复核。风险之间可能相关，不能随意相加。','Start with a low-risk benchmark in the valuation currency with a duration comparable to the receipts. Assess household payments and grid export collections, generation and operations, data integrity, contract enforceability and illiquidity. The equation is a calibration framework requiring evidence, not a way to generate one objectively correct rate. The intermediary should document each premium using agreement terms, payment history, grid settlement, station performance, exit limits and comparable transactions; the trustee reviews the rationale. Correlated risks cannot be priced by arbitrarily adding percentages.')
 para('模型已经把预计发电损失、费用或欠费计入未来净现金流时，不能把同一预期损失完整再计入风险溢价。例如某期预计应收100 USDC，但根据收款记录预计只收90 USDC，就应先解释现金流采用100还是90，再确定折现率覆盖哪些剩余风险。这里的“名义”表示现金流和利率都未剔除通胀，系统使用以实际天数为指数的年复利折现，并不是把简单月利率乘以12。合同税费口径、现金流币种、价格增长和预计收款日也必须一致。','When forecast cashflows already deduct expected generation loss, expenses or nonpayment, the same expected loss must not be charged again in full through the risk premium. For example, if 100 USDC is billed but only 90 USDC is expected to be collected, the report must state whether it discounts 100 or 90 and what residual risks the rate covers. Here, nominal means cashflows and rates are not adjusted for inflation; the system compounds the annual rate over actual days, rather than multiplying a simple monthly rate by 12. Tax treatment, cashflow currency, price growth and expected receipt dates must also be consistent.')
 sub('币种口径与当前系统限制','Currency convention and current system limitation')
 para('当前系统先按固定演示汇率把人民币业主电费、售电收入和站点费用换成USDC，再用同一个10%年利率按预计收款日折现。因此应把此利率理解为USDC计价收益权的要求回报。美元国债可作为低风险参考，但USDC、跨币种结算和合同执行风险仍要单独评估；固定汇率并不证明未来汇率不变。若改为人民币估值，应先用人民币口径利率折现人民币现金流，再于估值日换算现值，不能把人民币国债收益率直接套在已换成USDC的现金流上。','The current system converts CNY household bills, export proceeds and station costs into USDC using a fixed demonstration FX assumption, then discounts them at one 10% annual rate by expected collection date. The rate should therefore be read as the required return on USDC-denominated rights cashflows. US Treasury yields can be a low-risk reference, but USDC, cross-currency settlement and enforceability risks still require assessment. Fixed FX does not imply a constant future exchange rate. A CNY valuation should instead discount CNY cashflows with a CNY rate and convert the present value on the valuation date; applying a CNY bond yield directly to USDC cashflows is inconsistent.')
 para('以一年后收到41.888 USDC为例，采用6%、10%和14%折现时的现值分别约为39.52、38.08和36.74 USDC。每月实际计算使用各期预计收款日和估值日之间的天数，并不是把五年总收入一次性除以1.10。折现率上升影响报价，不代表业主电价或投资者合约现金流自动改变。','For 41.888 USDC expected exactly one year later, present values at 6%, 10% and 14% are approximately 39.52, 38.08 and 36.74 USDC. Each monthly receipt is discounted using the actual days from valuation to expected collection; five years of receipts are not divided by 1.10 just once. A higher discount rate changes the quote, not the owner tariff or the contractual investor cashflows automatically.')
 sub('可比资料与审批记录','Comparables and approval record')
 para('截至2026年11月12日可核对的公开资料中，11月10日美国国债五年期收益率为4.81%，11月12日中债五年期国债收益率为1.329%。与10%直接相减分别得到5.19和8.67个百分点，但两种币种不能混用，差值也不能证明这些风险溢价合理。IEA报告给出的2019年中国大型光伏项目税后名义加权资本成本在收入受保障时为4.4%至5.4%，在承担市场售电风险时为6.4%至6.9%。这些是不同规模和权利结构的历史融资成本，只能作为背景。Centrifuge现行文件按各产品估值政策确定NAV，旧版Tinlake说明中的3%只是教学算例，也不是协议统一利率。','As of 12 November 2026, the US Treasury five-year yield was 4.81% on 10 November and the ChinaBond five-year government yield was 1.329% on 12 November. Subtraction from 10% gives residuals of 5.19 and 8.67 percentage points respectively, but the currencies cannot be mixed and neither result validates a premium. The IEA reported nominal after-tax WACC of 4.4% to 5.4% for revenue-supported Chinese utility-scale solar projects in 2019 and 6.4% to 6.9% with merchant risk. These historical financing costs refer to a different scale and rights structure. Centrifuge now follows product-specific NAV policies; the 3% rate in its legacy Tinlake explanation is only an illustrative calculation, not a protocol-wide rate.')
 t(r'\par\noindent{\footnotesize\textbf{'+L('公开资料','Public sources')+r'}\quad '
   +r'\href{https://www.iea.org/articles/the-cost-of-capital-in-clean-energy-transitions}{IEA (2021)}; '
   +r'\href{https://docs.centrifuge.io/user/manager/nav/}{Centrifuge NAV}; '
   +r'\href{https://developer.centrifuge.io/developer/legacy/tinlake/}{Tinlake}; '
   +r'\href{https://yield.chinabond.com.cn/cbweb-pbc-web/pbc/more}{ChinaBond}; '
   +r'\href{https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?field_tdr_date_value=2026\&type=daily_treasury_yield_curve}{US Treasury}.}\par')
 para('每次正式报价应记录估值币种、基准曲线和观察日、溢价证据、已从预测现金流扣除的预期损失、复利口径、6%与10%及14%三种现值、审批人和估值有效期。取得足够实际业主缴费、电网回款及可比交易资料后，再校准本产品专属利率。新利率仅通过新报价或重新估值生效，不能静默改写已签协议。','Each formal quote should record its valuation currency, benchmark curve and observation date, evidence for the premiums, expected losses already deducted from forecast cashflows, compounding convention, present values at 6%, 10% and 14%, reviewer and validity period. Product-specific calibration requires sufficient realized household payments, grid proceeds and comparable transaction prices. A revised rate takes effect through a new quote or revaluation, never by silently rewriting a signed agreement.')
 sub('三种估值基线的比较','Comparison of the three valuation baselines')
 para('三种方法改变的是未来各期发电量或上网比例的预测基线。业主优惠电费、售电收入、约定成本、归集比例及按预计收款时间折现的现金流公式保持一致。因此，不能把三种基线理解为三套不同的收益权经济条款，也不能把估值折现率当成投资者的保证收益率。','The three methods change the forecast baseline for generation or export allocation in each future service period. The formulas for discounted household payments, export receipts, agreed costs, assignment and cashflow timing remain common. These baselines are not three different rights agreements, and the valuation discount rate is not a guaranteed investor return.')
 t(r'\begin{longtable}{L{3.1cm}L{5.4cm}L{6.2cm}}\toprule '+L('方法 & 发电量基线 & 上网量与适用条件', 'Method & Generation baseline & Export allocation and selection conditions')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('长期历史季节性 & 最多36个完整历史月，按相同日历月求平均，并按可用率、衰减和剩余期间修正。 & 用合格历史样本的上网与发电比例。历史不足、样本失衡或缺测时明确标为暂定，并要求审核。', 'Long-run historical seasonal & Up to 36 complete metered months, averaged by matching calendar month and adjusted for availability, degradation and remaining time. & Uses the export-to-generation ratio from eligible history. Short, missing or inconsistent evidence requires a provisional label and review.')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('近期上网比例 & 发电量仍取长期历史同月均值，不把近期单日发电直接外推整个期限。 & 用采集日前至少7个、最多30个完整日的合格上网比例。近期电量失衡时不可选，并须记录基线选择理由。', 'Recent export ratio & Generation still uses the long-run historical monthly mean; one recent day is never projected over the whole term. & Uses at least 7 and at most 30 eligible complete days before capture. An inconsistent recent energy balance disables this option; the choice requires review.')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('PVGIS 辐照气象基线 & 根据已记录或明确标为暂定的坐标、直流容量和组件设计，将2019—2023年历史气象逐小时模拟功率换算为各自然月单位发电量。 & 上网比例仍取德业合格历史样本。报告须说明参数状态、完整小时序列及来源摘要；只作为历史气象情景，不是未来天气预报。', 'PVGIS irradiation climate baseline & Converts 2019–2023 hourly modeled power to calendar-month specific yield using recorded or explicitly provisional coordinates, DC capacity and array design. & Export allocation still uses eligible Deye history. The report discloses parameter status, complete hourly records and source digest; this is a historical-weather scenario, not a future-weather forecast.')+r'\\\bottomrule\end{longtable}')
 para('截至2026年11月12日，私有链、原 Base Sepolia 和自托管 Oracle 三套应用均已部署 PVGIS 基线。上海电站可用下述暂定演示参数载入气象资料并试算新报价。参数状态保持为“演示估计”，不能称为德业确认的实装设计；已签协议和已发布产品不会自动重估。','As of 12 November 2026, the private-chain, original Base Sepolia and self-hosted Oracle applications all include the PVGIS baseline. The Shanghai station can load the provisional demonstration inputs below to preview a new quote. Their status remains “provisional demo estimate”; they are not an operator-confirmed as-built design, and signed agreements and published products are not automatically repriced.')
 t(r'\clearpage')
 sub('PVGIS 辐照气象基线估值','PVGIS irradiation-based climate valuation')
 para('第三种方法采用 PVGIS 5.3 的 ERA5 历史气象资料。服务端读取 2019—2023 年逐小时模拟功率，严格核对五年时序和接口返回的坐标、组件倾角、方位角、晶硅类型及单位，再换算各自然月平均 kWh/kWp。中介机构须记录各项电站参数的来源，并明确区分 API 记录值与暂定估计。','The third method uses PVGIS 5.3 ERA5 historical weather. The server reads modeled hourly power for 2019–2023, checks the complete series and the returned coordinates, tilt, aspect, crystalline-silicon type and units, then derives monthly mean kWh/kWp. The intermediary records the source of each station input and distinguishes API values from provisional estimates.')
 sub('上海电站的暂定演示参数','Provisional Shanghai station inputs')
 t(r'\begin{longtable}{L{3.5cm}L{3.2cm}L{8cm}}\toprule '+L('输入 & 取值 & 来源及限制','Input & Value & Source and limitation')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('坐标 & 北纬31.173725°，东经121.48858° & 德业 API 回放的 locationLat 与 locationLng，未由现场测量独立核实。','Coordinates & 31.173725° N, 121.48858° E & Recorded Deye API locationLat and locationLng; no independent site survey.')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('直流容量代理 & 40 kWp & API 的 installedCapacity 经单位映射后为40 kW，但接口未区分 DC 和 AC；本次暂以同一数值作直流容量代理。','DC capacity proxy & 40 kWp & API installedCapacity normalizes to 40 kW but does not distinguish DC from AC; the same numerical value is used provisionally.')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('固定倾角与方位角 & 30°，−2° & PVGIS 在记录坐标上给出的模型最优角度，方位略偏东；不是设备实测安装角度。','Tilt and aspect & 30°, −2° & PVGIS model-optimal fixed angles at the recorded location, slightly east of south; not measured as-built angles.')+r'\\\midrule')
 t(L('额外首年损耗 & 14\\% & 演示情景假设，非德业损耗测试结果。PVGIS 逐小时请求的 loss 设为零，随后只扣减一次。','Additional first-year loss & 14\\% & Demo scenario assumption, not a Deye loss measurement. The hourly PVGIS request uses zero loss, followed by one deduction.')+r'\\\bottomrule\end{longtable}')
 para('这份德业记录回放的观测时间为2026年9月24日中国标准时间。PVGIS 2019—2023年完整43,824个小时的单位容量年均模拟发电量为1,465.70 kWh/kWp；按40 kWp、14%额外损耗和现有98%可用率计算，首年示意发电量约为49,411.78 kWh。此结果不是德业电表读数，也不能证明40 kW为实际直流铭牌。原始 PVGIS 响应的 SHA-256 为 c2779962f6bc066525f9556b05ade82bcba9e8495c6eeb30c1cf31f20eef067c。中介和受托人仍须复核报价，其余电价、费用与上网分配另行说明。','The replayed Deye observation was captured on 24 September 2026 China Standard Time. The complete 43,824-hour PVGIS series for 2019–2023 yields a modeled mean of 1,465.70 kWh/kWp annually. At 40 kWp, 14% additional loss and the existing 98% availability assumption, illustrative first-year generation is 49,411.78 kWh. This is not a Deye meter reading or proof of the DC nameplate. The raw PVGIS response SHA-256 is c2779962f6bc066525f9556b05ade82bcba9e8495c6eeb30c1cf31f20eef067c. Intermediary and trustee review remains necessary; tariffs, expenses and export allocation are separate inputs.')
 t(r'\[G_t^{\mathrm{PVGIS}}=\Bigl(\sum_{m\in t}\bar Y_m\,\frac{\Delta t_m}{D_m}\Bigr)C_{\rm DC}(1-L)A(1-d)^{(t-1)/12},\qquad E_t=G_t^{\mathrm{PVGIS}}r_t^{\rm Deye}.\]')
 para('Y 是 PVGIS 基于 1 kWp、接口损耗设为零而计算的月度单位发电量；Δt/D 是服务期实际覆盖该自然月的比例；C 为已确认的直流侧容量或明确标注的暂定代理值；L 是另行审核的首年额外系统损耗，只扣一次；A 和 d 分别为可用率和衰减率。上网比例 r 来自德业合格历史样本，随后仍用共同公式计算业主电费、售电收入、成本和折现价值。原始 PVGIS 响应以 SHA-256 归档，报告分别绑定原始摘要与完整参数摘要。该情景不预报未来天气，也不证明德业实际发电或电网回款；报价仍需中介和受托人审核。','Y is modeled PVGIS monthly specific yield for 1 kWp with API loss set to zero. Delta t over D is the fraction of each calendar month actually covered by the service period. C is confirmed DC nameplate capacity or an explicitly provisional numerical proxy. L is separately reviewed first-year additional system loss applied once, and A and d are availability and degradation. Export ratio r comes from eligible Deye history. The common formulas then produce household payments, export receipts, costs and discounted value. The server archives the raw PVGIS response with SHA-256 and separately binds its raw and complete-parameter digests. This scenario does not forecast future weather or prove Deye-metered generation or grid payment; intermediary and trustee review remain required.')
 landscape();sub('前三期业主现金流时间轴','Owner cashflow timeline for the first three periods');rows=example['applications'][0]['offer']['rows'][:3]
